#     the union's near face (x=500).  Coverage is now asked PER RECT for an OVER
#     block, ADDED to the union requirement rather than replacing it.
#   • `complete_relay_junctions`' degenerate-collinear merge saw ONE segment —
#     the seed's per-rect stub (900,50)-(600,50), which lands on rect#1's face at
#     one end and on rect#0's at the other because the trunk sits on rect#0's far
#     face — as two collinear stubs, "merged" it into itself and ERASED it.
#   • its parallel/orthogonal OTC extensions drag a landing endpoint off the face
